# inc-47ws: the player stays put. 30 single "wait one turn" keys give the
# companion time to walk the scene; the probe logs one line per player action.
@while "-- more --" SPACE
# The fixture holds only the created character; setup-druid-shoulder-metal-seed7-opt0822.keys makes the state the old save held (bd inc-10v7f).
@include setup-druid-shoulder-metal-seed7-opt0822.keys
.*30
@dump:companion-trap
@quit
